docs\plans\2026-05-27-cave-byte-exact-verification.md:5:**Architecture:** Capture per-frame golden bundles from NES Z1 (NesHawk) at frames {0,8,16,24,60,120} per cave (covers bonfire 2-tile cycle + steady state). Capture same frames from Debug.md. Normalize NES 4-byte OAM → Genesis 8-byte SAT + tile-id translate via MANIFEST.json + PALRAM→CRAM via misc_palettes LUT. Byte-diff each domain. Every mismatch = a real bug to fix. Honest yes/no comes ONLY from the differ exit code.
docs\plans\2026-05-27-cave-byte-exact-verification.md:142:**Step 1:** Reuse `probe_one_gen.lua` cave-entry path (boot → navigate → force-warp). After cave scene confirmed (s_scene==2), force FrameCounter mirror to 0, capture SAT(640)+CRAM(128)+VRAM(per referenced tiles)+68K-RAM-ObjType at same relative frames {0,8,16,24,60,120}. Emit `gen_<id>/fNNN.bin`.
docs\plans\2026-05-27-cave-byte-exact-verification.md:144:Key: Gen SAT at VDP, read via existing dom_block("SAT_"). CRAM 128 bytes. For CHR comparison, read VRAM at the tile slots the SAT entries reference.
