docs\superpowers\plans\2026-05-02-roomrom-sprite-chr-expansion-plan.md:9:**VRAM-budget revision (2026-05-02 after T1 audit):** Audit (`tools/audit_vram_tile_usage.py`) shows full SPR bank stride is 549 tiles per sub-pal (Link + sword + common + sprites_chr + items). 4× the entire SPR bank = 2196 tiles, exceeds Genesis VRAM and collides with VDP table region at tile 1536. Approach revised to **per-category sub-pal expansion**: ITEM atlas gets its own bank with 4× sub-pal copies (the only category with non-trivial sub-pal variation); Link / sword / common stay 1× in the main SPR bank (always sub-pal 0).
