docs\superpowers\specs\2026-04-30-roomrom-s1-sprite-link-design.md:103:- `VDP_setSprite(0, x+0x80, y+0x80, SPRITE_SIZE(2,2), TILE_ATTR_FULL(PAL3, 0, 0, 0, 512+0x60), 0)`
