docs\debates\060-palette-architecture\r2_codex.md:46:First migration step: create one audited `scene_palette_apply()` plus a per-frame assertion/dump for the cave frame: expected full CRAM, SAT palette field, and sampled sprite nibble histogram for tiles `$5C/$5E`. Fix that single bonfire path until CRAM diff and rendered pixel diff both pass, then delete `_oam_dma` PAL0-tail routing.
